# Crystal Imperium play test: the DIFFICULTY option (challenge menu > Difficulty tab).
# Falkner's party is Pidgey / Rookidee / Noctowl, all at the level cap (11) on NORMAL (D21).
# EASY scales trainer levels to 90% (9 / 9 / 9), HARD to 110% rounded (12 / 12 / 12).
# Each new game is picked in the menu, then Falkner's lead is read from gBattleMons in battle.
# BattlePokemon: species +0, level +44; the opponent is battler 1 (+136).

# EASY
!new_game("EASY")
shot 01_easy_overworld.png
!give_mon(155, 11)
!battle_trainer(402)
wait 300
press A
wait 200
press A
wait 200
press A
wait 220
shot 02_easy_falkner.png
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 16 falkner_leads_pidgey_easy
expect8 {gBattleMons+180} 9 easy_pidgey_is_level_9
# Enemy party: Rookidee is the second Pokemon (level at +84)
expect8 {gEnemyParty+184} 9 easy_rookidee_is_level_9
expect8 {gEnemyParty+284} 9 easy_noctowl_is_level_9

# HARD
reset
!new_game("HARD")
!give_mon(155, 11)
!battle_trainer(402)
wait 300
press A
wait 200
press A
wait 200
press A
wait 220
shot 03_hard_falkner.png
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 16 falkner_leads_pidgey_hard
expect8 {gBattleMons+180} 12 hard_pidgey_is_level_12
expect8 {gEnemyParty+184} 12 hard_rookidee_is_level_12
expect8 {gEnemyParty+284} 12 hard_noctowl_is_level_12
